### MVP quest + AI (owners: Юля — game/events, Рома — ai). Paste accessToken from register/login.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Public discovery feed (афиша)
GET {{base}}/events?category=all

### Only festivals
GET {{base}}/events?category=festivals

### Game state: progress, routes, visible checkpoints
GET {{base}}/game
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Progress only
GET {{base}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Collect cp_y01 standing at its coordinates
POST {{base}}/checkpoints/cp_y01/collect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lat": 56.32370, "lng": 44.00200, "accuracyMeters": 15}

### Too far -> 403 TOO_FAR
POST {{base}}/checkpoints/cp_y02/collect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lat": 56.30000, "lng": 43.90000, "accuracyMeters": 15}

### Hidden route before 60 points -> 403 ROUTE_LOCKED
POST {{base}}/checkpoints/cp_g02/collect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lat": 56.32940, "lng": 43.99380, "accuracyMeters": 15}

### AI hint for a collected checkpoint
GET {{base}}/ai/hint?checkpointId=cp_y01&lang=ru
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI recommendations by level
GET {{base}}/ai/recommendations?lang=ru
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI status
GET {{base}}/ai/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
